#. module: bf_route
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_route/models/bf_route_notice.py:0
msgid ""
"<p><b>Your position at the stops</b></p><p>When you mark a stop (done, "
"customer absent, postponed), the application reads your phone's position "
"<b>once</b>, at that moment, and keeps it with the stop as proof of the "
"visit. It never follows you between stops, before the day starts or after it"
" ends.</p><p><b>Why:</b> to prove the visit to the customer and settle a "
"disagreement about a delivery. <b>Who sees it:</b> the people who manage the"
" routes. <b>How long:</b> %(how_long)s, then it is erased.</p><p>Your phone "
"asks for your permission the first time. If you refuse, the stops are marked"
" without a position.</p>"
msgstr ""

